ne  down in price for example carrots now  costing 57p a kilo of minced beef that's  about 10 lower than what it was many  more items have shot right up just a few  examples here uh a tin of baked beans up  by a quarter  up to 71 pence and tomatoes even more  costing around 2 pound and 83 pence in  total four-fifths of the hundreds of  products that we included in this  analysis have gone up in price in the  last five years and sadly things are  likely to get worse before they get  better our online tracker will be  constantly updated head to the sky news  website to explore the impact on your  shopping basket
 

